 "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "css_classes": "cm-o m-reveal"}, "elements": [{"id": "6a5b4dc", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"_css_classes": "cm-14", "title": "Confiable no es una palabra bonita. Es una forma de trabajar", "header_size": "h2"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "414f57e", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"_css_classes": "cm-6j", "editor": "<p>Queremos que nuestros clientes puedan delegar. Que cuando aparezca un problema sepan a quién llamar. Que no tengan que empezar cada conversación explicando desde cero qué tienen instalado. Y que cuando exista una forma mejor de hacer algo, no tengan que ser siempre ellos quienes la descubran.</p>"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "9c5b0ee", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"_css_classes": "cm-6k", "editor": "<p>Para nosotros, confianza significa:</p>"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "454d8b0", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "icon-list", "settings": {"_css_classes": "cm-6l", "icon_list": [{"_id": "761d698", "text": "<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"font-mono text-data text-cyan-ink-strong is-tabular\">01</span><span class=\"text-card-title\">Escuchar antes de proponer.</span>", "selected_icon": {"value": "", "library": ""}}, {"_id": "f4c1de5", "text": "<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"font-mono text-data text-cyan-ink-strong is-tabular\">02</span><span class=\"text-card-title\">Recomendar lo que tiene sentido.</span>", "selected_icon": {"value": "", "library": ""}}, {"_id": "a3b1840", "text": "<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"font-mono text-data text-cyan-ink-strong is-tabular\">03</span><span class=\"text-card-title\">Ejecutar, no quedarnos en el asesoramiento.</span>", "selected_icon": {"value": "", "library": ""}}, {"_id": "795a605", "text": "<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"font-mono text-data text-cyan-ink-strong is-tabular\">04</span><span class=\"text-card-title\">Dar la cara cuando algo falla.</span>", "selected_icon": {"value": "", "library": ""}}, {"_id": "29ad142", "text": "<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"font-mono text-data text-cyan-ink-strong is-tabular\">05</span><span class=\"text-card-title\">Y seguir pensando en cómo mejorar después de haber implantado la solución.</span>", "selected_icon": {"value": "", "library": ""}}]}, "elements": []}, {"id": "2ce3096", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "icon-list", "settings": {"_css_classes": "cm-6m cm-solo", "icon_list": [{"_id": "7f5a065", "text": "Porque la confianza no se consigue con palabras, sino resolviendo problemas una y otra vez.", "selected_icon": {"value": {"url": "@@ICONO_URL:shield-check@@", "id": "@@ICONO_ID:shield-check@@"}, "library": "svg"}}]}, "elements": []}]}, {"id": "4acca3e", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "css_classes": "cm-6n m-reveal"}, "elements": [{"id": "87fad47", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "image", "settings": {"_css_classes": "cm-6o", "image": {"url": "@@IMG_URL:/images/nosotros/nosotros-trust-delegar.webp@@", "id": "@@IMG_ID:/images/nosotros/nosotros-trust-delegar.webp@@", "alt": "La responsable de un hotel al teléfono en la oficina interna, tranquila, mientras al fondo se trabaja en la instalación"}, "image_size": "full"}, "elements": []}]}]}]}]}, {"id": "aea9ad4", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "css_classes": "cm-2w tone-light ms-nos-equipo", "html_tag": "section"}, "elements": [{"id": "3bcffb7", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "css_classes": "cm-w"}, "elements": [{"id": "33e292e", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "css_classes": ""}, "elements": [{"id": "4b37bd6", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "css_classes": "m-block"}, "elements": [{"id": "13fbd16", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "css_classes": "cm-6p m-reveal"}, "elements": [{"id": "c737fa2", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"_css_classes": "cm-6q", "title": "Un equipo. Muchas capacidades", "header_size": "h2"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "7555821", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "css_classes": "cm-3s"}, "elements": [{"id": "cd2a198", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"_css_classes": "cm-6r", "editor": "<p>Hay empresas excelentes en conectividad. Otras en WiFi. Otras en IPTV. Otras en voz fija y móvil. Y otras se especializan en inteligencia artificial.</p>"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "4b8c6ec", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"_css_classes": "cm-62", "editor": "<p>Nuestra fortaleza es poder entender el conjunto. Y hacernos cargo de la complejidad que aparece cuando todas esas piezas tienen que funcionar juntas.</p>"}, "elements": []}]}]}, {"id": "3864d7b", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "icon-list", "settings": {"_css_classes": "cm-6s m-reveal", "icon_list": [{"_id": "a9a487b", "text": "Conectividad", "selected_icon": {"value": {"url": "@@ICONO_URL:radio@@", "id": "@@ICONO_ID:radio@@"}, "library": "svg"}}, {"_id": "01d0793", "text": "Voz fija y centralita virtual", "selected_icon": {"value": {"url": "@@ICONO_URL:phone-call@@", "id": "@@ICONO_ID:phone-call@@"}, "library": "svg"}}, {"_id": "949a623", "text": "Móvil", "selected_icon": {"value": {"url": "@@ICONO_URL:smartphone@@", "id": "@@ICONO_ID:smartphone@@"}, "library": "svg"}}, {"_id": "5b53fbc", "text": "WiFi", "selected_icon": {"value": {"url": "@@ICONO_URL:wifi@@", "id": "@@ICONO_ID:wifi@@"}, "library": "svg"}}, {"_id": "d49f59e", "text": "IPTV", "selected_icon": {"value": {"url": "@@ICONO_URL:tv@@", "id": "@@ICONO_ID:tv@@"}, "library": "svg"}}, {"_id": "2913908", "text": "Integraciones", "selected_icon": {"value": {"url": "@@ICONO_URL:workflow@@", "id": "@@ICONO_ID:workflow@@"}, "library": "svg"}}, {"_i