ontainer", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "css_classes": "cm-o"}, "elements": [{"id": "4b9d1b3", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"_css_classes": "cm-6y", "title": "Tecnología que resuelve lo de hoy y se anticipa a lo de mañana", "header_size": "h2"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "21e1b54", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"_css_classes": "cm-6z", "editor": "<p>No creemos que innovar consista en añadir tecnología porque esté de moda. Consiste en detectar cuándo una nueva solución puede hacer más sencilla la operación, mejorar la experiencia del huésped o quitar trabajo al equipo.</p>"}, "elements": []}]}, {"id": "a087ab7", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "css_classes": "cm-o"}, "elements": [{"id": "a1ee8e6", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"_css_classes": "cm-47", "editor": "<p>iAndrea es un ejemplo de esa forma de entender la innovación. No nace para que un hotel pueda decir que utiliza inteligencia artificial. Nace para que una llamada no se pierda porque recepción está ocupada, para que determinadas consultas no interrumpan continuamente al equipo y para que la tecnología absorba tareas que no necesitan a una persona.</p>"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "e7029a8", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"_css_classes": "cm-70", "editor": "<p>Ese es el tipo de innovación que nos interesa. Tecnología útil. Aplicada con sentido.</p>"}, "elements": []}]}]}]}, {"id": "ea255cc", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "css_classes": "cm-6w m-block"}, "elements": [{"id": "2ed2c09", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "css_classes": "cm-71 m-reveal"}, "elements": [{"id": "9866317", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "css_classes": "cm-o"}, "elements": [{"id": "f6e96d6", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"_css_classes": "cm-72", "title": "<span class=\"block\">Hoy resolvemos.</span><span class=\"block\">Mañana nos anticipamos</span>", "header_size": "h2"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "402fe73", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "css_classes": "cm-73"}, "elements": [{"id": "2f37633", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"_css_classes": "cm-47", "editor": "<p>No queremos limitarnos a reaccionar cuando algo falla. Queremos conocer suficientemente bien <em class=\"mark-hotel\">tu hotel</em> como para poder proponerte mejoras antes de que tengas que pedirlas.</p>"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "08b207d", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"_css_classes": "cm-48", "editor": "<p>Porque ser un buen partner tecnológico no consiste solo en responder. También consiste en mirar un poco más adelante.</p>"}, "elements": []}]}]}, {"id": "05442ae", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "css_classes": "cm-o"}, "elements": [{"id": "4cfa904", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "image", "settings": {"_css_classes": "cm-74", "image": {"url": "@@IMG_URL:/images/nosotros/nosotros-innovacion-preparado.webp@@", "id": "@@IMG_ID:/images/nosotros/nosotros-innovacion-preparado.webp@@", "alt": ""}, "image_size": "full"}, "elements": []}]}]}]}]}]}]}, {"id": "330cbc3", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "css_classes": "cm-75 tone-dark ms-cierre", "html_tag": "section"}, "elements": [{"id": "c625169", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "html", "settings": {"_css_classes": "dl-flat", "html": "<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"pointer-events-none absolute -top-16 right-0 size-[min(420px,50vw)]\" data-brand-arc=\"focus\" focusable=\"false\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" style=\"opacity:0.3\" viewbox=\"0 0 200 200\"><path d=\"M 8 168 C 8 60 92 8 192 32\" fill=\"none\" pathlength=\"1\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-width=\"3\" vector-effect=\"non-scaling-stroke\"></path></svg>"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "f281c4c", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "css_classes": "cm-w"}, "elements": [{"id": "a87ee0e", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "css_classes": "cm-2p"}, "elements": [{"id": "e50fae9", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"_css_classes": "cm-1p m-reveal", "title": "¿Hay algo que podría funcionar mejor en <em class=\"mark-hotel\">tu hotel</em>?", "header_size": "h2"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "742feef", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "css_classes": "cm-76 m-reveal"}, "elements": [{"id": "87bd1ff", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"_css_classes": "cm-5l", "editor": "<p>Cuéntanoslo.</p>"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "7830ba0", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"_css_classes": "cm-5l", "editor": "<p>Puede que ya sepamos cómo resolverlo.</p>"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "8120376", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"_css_classes": "cm-5m", "editor": "<p>Y puede que detectemos algo que todavía no habías considerado.</p>"}, "elements": []}]}, {"id": "8213a4a", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "css_classes": "cm-77 m-reveal"}, "elements": [{"id": "ff6b0f8", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "button", "settings": {"_css_classes": "cm-5o cm-btn is-btn-marca is-icono-despues group/btn", "text": "Habla con Comunica", "link": {"url": "/contacto", "is_external": "", "nofollow": "", "custom_attributes": ""}, "selected_icon": {"value": {"url": "@@ICONO_URL:arrow-right@@", "id": "@@ICONO_ID:arrow-right@@"}, "library": "svg"}, "icon_align": "row-reverse"}, "elements": []}]}]}]}]}]}]